  "term": "negative imagery",
  "definition": "Negative imagery is distressing mental pictures about oneself, especially in social situations. In the supplied source, it refers to negative self-imagery that is commonly reported by socially anxious adolescents and is considered a possible factor that helps keep social anxiety going.",
